  "title": "BBVA completes the extraordinary share buyback program launched in December 2025 for nearly €4 billion",
  "summary": "BBVA has completed the final tranche of the extraordinary share buyback program announced in December 2025. Between 6 May and 3 August 2026, the Group repurchased shares worth €1.46 billion, bringing to a close the largest share buyback program in its history, with a total value of €3.96 billion.",
